    description: "WI-tubot full-corpus run (2026-04-11, 11 repos, 92218 candidates) categorized only 6% of dead-code candidates: cross_language_api=3187, handler_or_dto=1631, swagger_generated=514, memberlist_callbacks=100, goroutine_lifecycle=25, yaml_json_marshal=20, pipeline_stage_dispatch=7, cobra_cli_dispatch=3. The remaining 86731 'uncategorized' candidates represent untapped signal — without categorization, prospector output cannot rank linker-investment priorities beyond the recognised top 6%. Inspect ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/prospector_runs/run-2026-04-11-full/per_repo[*].json for sample uncategorized candidate shapes (names, paths, kinds). Expected new categories: callback_registration (on_*, handle_*, *Listener), dependency_injection constructor params (*Service, *Provider), message-queue consumers (*Consumer, *Subscriber), CLI/route registration patterns not yet tagged. Each new category unlocks one class of structural linker fix."  # d92c
